Overconfidence.  It will kill you every time.
It certainly killed Moo, the elf wanabe (see armour and weapons).

Weapons
D - 18 rustproof +7 daggers named DaggerStorm! (in quiver)
U - the +6 Sting (weapon in hand)

Armor
u - a blessed +6 elven mithril-coat (being worn)
w - a blessed +7 elven leather helm (being worn)
B - a blessed +7 elven cloak (being worn)
F - a blessed +5 pair of gauntlets of dexterity (being worn)
H - an uncursed fireproof +7 pair of elven boots (being worn)
O - a blessed +7 elven shield (being worn)

Gauntlets of dex because they were the closest thing I could find to
"elven gloves".  Since he really wanted to be an elf, Daggerstorm
should really have been elven daggers, but that's beside the point.

Moo had masterminded the castle tune and was busy playing
squish the monster that comes out the gate.  However, he grew
impatient with this and decided that he could melee with whatever
came out the gate for a while, then go back to playing squish again.
He walked up to the drawbridge, beat up a few creatures with Sting,
but then trouble began.

Problem no 1.
A titan began summoning monsters around Moo.

Problem no 2.
An umber hulk confused Moo.

Problem no 3.
A random monster had a wand of striking

Problem no 4.
DYWYPI?

Since I had filled in the moat with a scroll of earth, I thought
that if the drawbridge was destroyed I wouldn't drown.  I was
correct, I didn't drown, but that doesn't matter when you get
hit in the head with a huge chuck of drawbridge or portcullis
or whatever it was.

In retrospect, I should have broken a wand of teleport or read
a scroll of taming as soon as the titan began summoning
and then just got the heck out of there... or at least back to
a safe space.

Would have...
Should have...
Could have...
Didn't.

Oh well. I guess I'll just chalk this one up to experience and
start another elvish wanabe.

I was really happy with how this character was going too.

* I hadn't used any wishes and wasn't planning on using
any once I got the castle wand.
* I hadn't polymorphed myself, or any items.
* I hadn't genocided any monsters and wasn't planning on doing so.

Oh well.

Nothing to do but try again.

